# Architecture source of truth

Treat [architecture.md](../../architecture.md) as the source of truth for architecture plans, canonical paths, and how skills are recomposed.

- Canonical orchestration lives in `src/swe/skills/swe/SKILL.md`.
- Canonical writing skill lives in `src/editor-eli/skills/editor-eli/SKILL.md`.
- Recompose via `.cursor/skills/recompose/SKILL.md`. Write generated artifacts only under `dist/`.
- Do not paraphrase a canonical skill. Edit source, then recompose.
